<mod>
  <name>Refinery Ship Parts</name>
  <description>The idea of this mod is to add items which will not easily fit into a combat ship. This is to encourage the creation of a second "refinery" support ship which would hyper space into sectors only after they are cleared by a combat- focused ship. Ideally these items would have a rule to dictate that they cannot function with a shield generator/scanner on board.</description>
  <minimumLoaderVersion>0.0.2</minimumLoaderVersion>
  <gameVersions>
    <v>0.4.1</v>
  </gameVersions>
</mod>
